  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"g54LL\" id=\"g54LL\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a1ea99a\" id=\"u8a1ea99a\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">修改配置</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u13fe615d\" id=\"u13fe615d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uacf8f471\" id=\"uacf8f471\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如果想重启之后，文件不丢失，你需要做如下配置。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua8f64c1f\" id=\"ua8f64c1f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf48be374\" id=\"uf48be374\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">/root/T113-Tina5.0-V1.2/openwrt/target/t113/t113-evb1_auto/base-files/etc/config/fstab</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22config%20'mount'%5Cn%20%20%20%20option%20%20target%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'%2Foverlay'%5Cn%20%20%20%20option%20%20device%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'%2Fdev%2Fby-name%2FUDISK'%5Cn%20%20%20%20option%20%20options%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'rw%2Casync'%5Cn%20%20%20%20option%20%20enabled%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'1'%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oHIUa%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u03c5bf57\" id=\"u03c5bf57\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d5002dd\" id=\"u5d5002dd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\">重新编译，烧录镜像。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2767c0b1\" id=\"u2767c0b1\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"PQqLT\" id=\"PQqLT\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1fec1156\" id=\"u1fec1156\">验明正身</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u65a2f168\" id=\"u65a2f168\"><span data-lake-id=\"uea9eb777\" id=\"uea9eb777\">为了让你百分之百安心，你可以做最后一次简单的测试：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u25370771\" id=\"u25370771\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc71ffca\" id=\"ufc71ffca\">在系统的根目录下创建一个测试文件：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22echo%20%5C%22Hello%20TinaLinux%5C%22%20%3E%20%2Froot%2Ftest_reboot.txt%5Cnsync%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22si9Ey%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u62c5f815\"><li fid=\"u81489a2a\" data-lake-id=\"u9f7ab85c\" id=\"u9f7ab85c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u601daf71\" id=\"u601daf71\">拔掉开发板的电源线（直接硬断电），然后再插上重新开机。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uf5b39ca8\" id=\"uf5b39ca8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u603674a6\" id=\"u603674a6\">重新进入终端，查看文件是否还在：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22cat%20%2Froot%2Ftest_reboot.txt%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gh70D%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2a775a23\" id=\"u2a775a23\"><span data-lake-id=\"udec3c472\" id=\"udec3c472\">只要这个文件还能打印出 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9597059f\" id=\"u9597059f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf381269d\" id=\"uf381269d\">Hello TinaLinux</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u17614a6d\" id=\"u17614a6d\">，就宣告着你的配置持久化功能已经坚如磐石。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4e3d7603\" id=\"u4e3d7603\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue01e59e4\" id=\"ue01e59e4\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u03fa3f3b\" id=\"u03fa3f3b\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc166a6d9\" id=\"uc166a6d9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2c152bd7\" id=\"u2c152bd7\">sync</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3b07905e\" id=\"u3b07905e\"> 命令的作用是：强制要求 Linux 内核立刻将内存中所有还未落盘的“脏数据”全部写入物理 Flash。</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0fcd9593\" id=\"u0fcd9593\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb3eadd2\" id=\"ufb3eadd2\">敲完 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u30a0cccf\" id=\"u30a0cccf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua95c5390\" id=\"ua95c5390\">sync</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u548204ad\" id=\"u548204ad\">（通常零点几秒就会执行完毕），这时候你再去拔掉电源线。再次插电开机执行 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u89e46537\" id=\"u89e46537\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud70f7aa2\" id=\"ud70f7aa2\">cat /root/test_reboot.txt</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5c7bd603\" id=\"u5c7bd603\">，你的内容就绝对完美保留在里面了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u08282697\" id=\"u08282697\"><br></p>",
